{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28375","headline":"池州李使君没後十一日处州新命始到後见归妓感而成诗 · 杜牧","name":"池州李使君没後十一日处州新命始到後见归妓感而成诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缙云新命诏初行，才是孤魂寿器成。\n黄壤不知新雨露，粉书空换旧铭旌。\n巨卿哭处云空断，阿骛归来月正明。\n多少四年遗爱事，乡闾生子李爲名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}